Omarchy: protobuf 7 removed FieldDescriptor.label (deprecated in favour of
is_repeated / is_required).  _validate_footprint_coordinates used it, so every
footprint move failed with AttributeError against python-protobuf 7.35.1
(12 failures in tests/test_bridge.py).  is_repeated is its replacement.

--- a/src/kicad_mcp/bridge.py
+++ b/src/kicad_mcp/bridge.py
@@ -148,7 +148,7 @@
             return
         for descriptor, value in message.ListFields():
             if descriptor.message_type is not None:
-                if descriptor.label == descriptor.LABEL_REPEATED:
+                if descriptor.is_repeated:
                     for child in value:
                         validate(child)
                 else:
